    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(Prerequisite: Eberron Campaign, Can't Have Another Dragonmark Feat)</em></p><p>The Mark of Passage of House Orien manifests on your skin. You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Intuitive Motion.</strong> When you make a Strength (Athletics) or Dexterity (Acrobatics) check, you can roll 1d4 and add the number rolled to the check.</p><p><strong>Courier's Speed.</strong> Your Speed increases by 5 feet.</p><p><strong>Magical Passage.</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMistyStep0]{Misty Step} is always prepared for you. You can cast it once without a spell slot, and you regain that use when you finish a Long Rest; you can also cast it with any spell slots you have. Your spellcasting ability for this spell is Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma (chosen when you take this feat).</p><p><strong>Spells of the Mark.</strong> If you have the Spellcasting or Pact Magic feature, the spells on the Mark of Passage Spells table are added to that feature's spell list.</p><h4>Mark of Passage Spells</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Spell Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplExpeditiou]{Expeditious Retreat}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplJump000000]{Jump}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFindSteed0]{Find Steed}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPasswithou]{Pass without Trace}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBlink00000]{Blink}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplPhantomSte]{Phantom Steed}</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDimensionD]{Dimension Door}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFreedomofM]{Freedom of Movement}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplTeleportat]{Teleportation Circle}</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-BVU9szMFLE9Wb1J9\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect <em>Intuitive Motion</em> adds the 1d4 to the Athletics and Acrobatics checks. The Spells of the Mark are not added to your class spell list automatically: prepare them from the compendium if your class can. The effect <em>Courier's Speed</em> adds the 5 feet.</p></section>",
